The final result should feel like a real, professionally developed puzzle game that players can open, understand, play immediately, and enjoy for a long time.

**Most Important Requirement:** Every puzzle must have clear rules, every level must be solvable, every essential control must work, and mobile and desktop players must receive an equally smooth and enjoyable experience.